-Skip tidy triagebot linkcheck if triagebot.toml doesn't exist
-
-Distribution tarballs won't include triagebot.toml, which
-causes tidy checks to fail with the following error:
-
-   tidy error: triagebot.toml file not found
-   some tidy checks failed
-
-Drop the triagebot.toml check which is mostly to catch broken
-path filters *within* `triagebot.toml` and not enforce
-the existence of it.
-
-Upstream-Status: Backport [<a class=3D"moz-txt-link-freetext" href=3D"http=
s://github.com/rust-lang/rust/pull/142666/commits">https://github.com/rust-=
lang/rust/pull/142666/commits</a>]
-
-Signed-off-by: Yash Shinde <a class=3D"moz-txt-link-rfc2396E" href=3D"mail=
to:Yash.Shinde@windriver.com">&lt;Yash.Shinde@windriver.com&gt;</a>
